//! The `caret-animation` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property is used to
//! enable or disable the blinking behavior of the insertion caret, the visible marker that appears
//! in editable elements to indicate where the next character will be inserted or deleted.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: auto | manual
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui-4/#propdef-caret-animation
//!
//! Author guide:
